+## Discount codes
+
+An order takes one discount code at most with `orders.applyCode(orderNumber, code)`; a second code replaces the first.
+The code takes its discount off the order's items, never off shipping, and the order's totals show it as
+`discountCents`. Whether the order ships free is decided on its items before the discount.
+
+- `SPRING10` takes 10 % off the items, rounded to the nearest cent (a half cent rounds up).
+- `WELCOME5` takes 5.00 € off the items, only on an order whose items come to 30.00 € or more.
+
+An unknown code, or `WELCOME5` on a smaller order, is refused with an error that says why, and the order is left as
+it was.
